window.products.push({"id":1149059,"name":"CHITA Modern Accent Chairs for Living Room Furniture Sets with Arms in Velvet Fabric, Falkirk Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MZxDWkOpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOULMATE CHAIR: This armchair features classic mid-century style with exquisite French welt. Take a seat and you are set for reading, napping, or watching your favorite movies. ENJOY YOUR LIFE: The slightly flared arms create a vivid silhouette. Neither too soft nor too firm. Seat firmness: On a scale from 1 to 5 (5 being firmest), it's a 3. Front leg height is 9.4'' and rear leg height is 8.7'', allowing your robot vacuum easily slide under the chair. Easy to assemble, disassemble, transport & reassemble. BUILT TO LAST: Upon the birth of the Accent Chiar, we have conducted in-house testing to guarantee the superior quality of our product. The sofa successfully passes durability test for seat, back and arm. (How is durability test performed: A certain load is applied to seat, back and arm to simulate everyday use of the sofa. After 60000 cycles of applying the functional load, there is no structural breakage or loss of serviceablility.) ENVIRONMENT FRIENDL: Our foam is environmentally friendly with the seal of approval certified by CertiPUR-US, Made without ozone depleters, Made without PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (\"Tris\") flame retardants, Made without mercury, lead, and other heavy metals, Made without formaldehyde, Made without phthalates regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission, Low VOC (Volatile Organic Compound) emissions for indoor air quality (less than 0.5 parts per million) COMFORT: We know all there is to know about comfort. So we tested numerous ways of seat and back construction to create the most comfortable sofa on the market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MZxDWkOpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHITA","source_asin":"B094VWMT9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094VWMT9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094VWMT9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
