window.products.push({"id":1149173,"name":"RICOVERO Healthy Ceramic Nonstick Cookware Set, 3 Piece Forged Aluminum Pot and Pan Set with Lid – Soft Grip – Dishwasher Safe - 100% PFOA, Lead, & Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uhH6wdBpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The RICOVERO Healthy Ceramic Nonstick Cookware Set is a top-of-the-line kitchen essential that offers a unique combination of style and functionality. This 3-piece set includes a pot, a pan, and a lid that fits both, making it perfect for preparing a variety of dishes. The set comes in 5 different colors - Royal Blue, Charcoal, Gold, Violet, and Scarlet - and 3 different sizes - 8\", 9.5\", and 11\" - to suit every need and kitchen décor. Crafted from high-quality forged aluminum, this cookware set is durable and sturdy. The pots and pans are 3.5 mm thick and feature a spiral bottom of 4.5 mm thickness, ensuring even heat distribution and preventing hot spots. This makes it perfect for preparing a range of dishes, including soups, stews, pasta, and more. The spiral bottom also ensures that the cookware set works on all countertops, except induction. The RICOVERO Healthy Ceramic Nonstick Cookware Set is also 100% PFOA, Lead, and Cadmium-free, making it safe for cooking food. It features a double nonstick white ceramic coating that is designed to provide superior performance and easy cleanup. The nonstick surface ensures that food doesn't stick to the pots and pans, making it ideal for cooking dishes that require minimal oil or butter. This makes it perfect for those who are looking for healthy cooking options. The cookware set also features soft-grip handles that provide a comfortable and secure grip while cooking. The lid has a tight-fitting design that helps to seal in moisture and heat, ensuring that food remains warm for a longer period of time. Another great feature of the RICOVERO Healthy Ceramic Nonstick Cookware Set is that it is dishwasher safe, making cleanup a breeze. Overall, the RICOVERO Healthy Ceramic Nonstick Cookware Set is a must-have for every kitchen. Its unique features, including its high-quality construction, nonstick coating, soft-grip handles, and dishwasher-safe design, make it a top-performing and stylish addition to any home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uhH6wdBpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RICOVERO","source_asin":"B08DN3Q7YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DN3Q7YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DN3Q7YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
