window.products.push({"id":1149229,"name":"Scented Soy Candle (White Sage Lavender, 6 oz.)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71doWoxj+pL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"All our candles are made using soy wax, it's eco-friendly, renewable, sustainable, carbon neutral, all natural & toxin free. It's also American grown, which means supporting local farmers. PLUS it burns longer & cleaner. The wicks are cotton & lead free. The fragrance is a blend of natural and synthetic, and never contains phthalate, carcinogens, reproductive toxins, mutagens, organ toxins and acute toxins.SCENT DESCRIPTIONS: Mahogany Teak: Dry notes of Mahogany, and teak perfectly mixed with bergamot, sweet citron, ylang ylang, and cinnamon bark. White Sage & Lavender: This ultra calming scent is a blend of herbs, lavender, and aromatic woods. Eucalyptus Spearmint: Inspired by the original Eucalyptus Spearmint, this clean scent has a eucalyptus heart enhanced with fresh minty notes. Apple Harvest: A ripe apple fragrance combined with bright fruit notes and a touch of spice. Top notes include orange peel, cinnamon, and nutmeg, middle note of apple and a base of clove and vanilla. Frosted Gingerbread: Straight out of the oven gingerbread cookies combined with vanilla frosting - notes of ginger, cream, butter, and graham cracker come through, with familiar aromas of vanilla, molasses, and spices. Sweet Pumpkin: Toasty top notes of cinnamon, nutmeg, and clove give way to middle accords of silky buttercream, vanilla and pumpkin. Christmas Tree: The perfect Christmas Tree scent! This scent opens with refreshing ozone & cooling eucalyptus, middle notes of cypress, moss, and bayberry blend with rich undertones of fir balsam, patchouli & sweet incense. Burning Instructions: Trim wick to 1/4\" before lighting. Keep candle free of any foreign materials including matches and wick trimmings. Only burn the candle on a level, fire resistant surface. Do not burn candle for more than four hours at a time. Burn within sight and keep away from children and pets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71doWoxj+pL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baum Designs","source_asin":"B09KP2VQ5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KP2VQ5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KP2VQ5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
