window.products.push({"id":1149266,"name":"Food Storage Container, Airtight Vacuum Lid Food Storage Container, BPA-Free with Lids by KITCHENTREND","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916w+gFB2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUILT-IN VACUUM PUMP: Each lid of KITCHENTREND food storage container includes a patented built-in Vacuum Pump - Lids keep air & moisture out of the container, no separate pump or batteries required! Independent 3rd Party Laboratory Tested - Creating a vacuum in the container helps to extend the shelf life of stored foods (follow use and care instruction inside box) MULTI FUNCTIONS: Not only are these KITCHENTREND airtight storage containers good for dry foods, but also great for holding liquids such as water, juice, soup, and more. Container corners allow for easy pouring. Don't worry about spills as the containers are designed to seal all liquids with airtight technology. Besides, the storage containers are easy to clean, simply remove the lid attached along the lids of each container and wash with soap and rinse with water. CONVENIENCE: One size lid (black) KITCHENTREND food storage containers fits each container size, no lid and base matching required! All KITCHENTREND airtight storage containers are USDA Food Safe, BPA Free, Shatter Resistant Containers. The containers made from highly durable food safe and BPA free polycarbonate will not absorb odors or stains. VERSATILE: KITCHENTREND airtight vacuum storage containers are freezer, fridge, microwave and Dishwasher Safe. Store your favorite foods safely into these efficient food storage containers, you don't have to worry about jamming your edibles into containers. SATISFACTORY GUARANTEE: If you are not satisfied with our product, please contact us. We provide 20 months warranty and friendly customer service for our products. With a stackable and modular design, these containers will save you a ton of space in your pantry and cabinets for better kitchen organization, so just feel free to add them in your cart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916w+gFB2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITCHENTREND","source_asin":"B0735Z6HT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0735Z6HT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0735Z6HT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
