window.products.push({"id":1149394,"name":"Electric Kettle, 1.7L Glass Electric Tea Kettle, Hot Water Kettle with Auto Shut-Off & Boil-Dry Protection, Fast Heating Cordless Water Boiler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F--XMiCRS._AC_SL1166_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a hot beverage minus the fuss with this modern, space-saving glass kettle ✔ Quick Boil: Save precious minutes boiling water in the kettle instead of on the stove. Even use kettle-boiled water to supplement whatever’s simmering stovetop. ✔ Stainless Steel Filter: Water goes through an extra stainless steel filter at the spout. ✔ Sturdy Handle: Get a good grip on your kettle and pour yourself some hot water! ✔ Durable Materials: A minimalist and stylish design is outfitted with food-grade stainless steel and glass. Safe to use—and elegant to have around. ✔ Wide-Mouth Opening: Easily reach the inside of the kettle through its opening to wipe down or wash the glass with a rag or sponge. ✔ Blue LED indicator: Enjoy watching the process of boiling when the light is on. ✔ Boil-Dry Protection: Automatically shuts off the hot water kettle electric when it is boiling dry. ✔ 360 Degree Swivel Base: Conveniently lift the cordless glass water kettle from the base and set it down from every angle. Specifications: Standards: 110V/60Hz/1100W Capacity: 1.7 Liter(1.8 Quart) Warm Tips: 1)Please make sure water is lower then the max level otherwise it may leak out through inner steam path in boiling process. 2) It is normal to have spot or rust on the stainless steel bottom after some time, please clean it regularly with lemon juice or vineg. 3)Do not add cold water into the kettle immediately after pouring out boiled water. It is recommended to wait at least 30 seconds between 2 continuous cycles. 4)Ensure the lid is properly closed before switching on the kettle, otherwise, it may not properly switch off. 5)To prevent fire, please keep the kettle away from heat source like stove, oven, or radiator.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F--XMiCRS._AC_SL1166_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diowner","source_asin":"B09J8M4F1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J8M4F1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J8M4F1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
