window.products.push({"id":1149425,"name":"Mother of Pearl Inlay Round Serving Tray | Coffee Table Wooden Tray w Insert Handles - Luxury Decorative Platters for Party, Dinner, Breakfast in Bed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715suvGBhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTY AND FUNCTION - The mother or pearl inlay coating makes this wooden serving tray a unique serveware and decorative piece for the dining table. It adds character and a luxury touch to many styles of decor. That’s why this special serving tray is an ideal housewarming gift. VERSATILE - The wood tray serving food, breakfast, bread, snacks, drink, tea and coffee table. It is often used as a breakfast tray and decorative storage tray for bar, kitchen bathroom, living room and your home. This tray can also be used to display flowers, special ornaments or create eye-catching table centerpieces PREMIUM QUALITY - Our mother of pearl inlay serving and coffee trays are crafted by hand of Vietnamese artisans. It is light, made of wood and hand made to last a long time. The tray is designed with an inserted handle so it's easy to carry around. The bottom is covered with a soft, thick layer of paint so the tray leaves no scratches on the table surface during usage EARTH-FRIENDLY – Made Terra trays are made of pine wood, a renewable resource. Pine forests remain constant in size because they grow quickly and are easily replanted. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and serving table solution. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our nacre serving tray, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Boi Khe, home to Vietnamese nacre inlaying arts. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online. KINDLY NOTE: In case you have any concerns with the purchased item or the product has any defects, PLEASE do not hesitate to request replacement items, a perfect alternation will be promptly sent to you with no additional fee. No return is required for the original ones. Our customer service is always ready to co-operate. Your satisfaction is our top priority! UNIQUE GIFT: This gorgeous item is a perfect present for Holiday Season, New Year, Christmas Eve, Celebrations for natural lovers and minimalist, an ideal gift to express love and gratitude in Noel and special events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715suvGBhTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09BN9V7JJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BN9V7JJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BN9V7JJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
