window.products.push({"id":1149703,"name":"Mad Mats Daisy Indoor/Outdoor Floor Mat, 5 by 8-Feet, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512GOS9j+UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description He loves me, he loves me not regardless, you're sure to love the daisy collection by Mad Mats. Featuring larger than life flowers against a colorful background. Mad Mats are made from 100% recycled plastic, are UV protected and fade-proof, and come with our one-year color guarantee. Because our rugs are handmade, pattern, color and size may vary slightly. From the Manufacturer Mad Mats' patterns are intricately woven. Multi-colored threads are woven in much the same fashion as real flat weave wool rugs. The result is a warmth and depth of color usually only available to the interior rug market. Most outdoor plastic mats on the market today are made from a combination of virgin polypropylene (PPL) and polystyrene. Mad Mats' plastic is completely different. First, our polypropylene is recycled from used soda bottles, milk bottles, packing, etc. We use only the highest grade of this recycled PPL. Then we combine it with state of the art conditioners and U.V. inhibitors to produce soft, resilient colorfast threads. Our soft tubular threads don't absorb dirt or stains of any kind. Leaves, debris, and food spills are easily rinsed away with a garden hose. They are truly carefree! This is a major advantage of Mad Mats. Most outdoor rugs are a dense weave of spun poly thread. They hold moisture for days which then gets tracked into the house. Grass, food, and dirt seep into the fiber where they remain until the rug is pulled up and washed, dried, and put back in place. YUCK! Mad Mats breathe. They don't trap water so they won't mildew and they won't rot wooden decks. Water goes right through them and evaporates right back out of them. Walking on Mad Mats the morning after a rainy night will leave your feet dry enough to walk right into the house. You put it down and that's it! All Mariachi products are produced under fair trade conditions. We do not work with factories that employ children or produce environmentally harmful waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512GOS9j+UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mad Mats®","source_asin":"B00865M3BK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00865M3BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00865M3BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1149704,"name":"Dish Drying Rack, 2-Tier Dish Rack and Drainboard Set, Large Dish Drainer Kitchen Dish Drying Rack with Drainboard, Cup Holders, Adjustable Pan and Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jAtCmX9-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Organizing Vertical Rack Saves Counter Space Perfectly】--The 2 tier dish rack offers much vertical space (15.7x10.6x20.9 inches) without occupying much space of countertop; the larger room (12 inches height) between 2 tiers lets users store the bigger dishes and position them easily; moreover, the lower tier with deeper dividers (2.6 inches height) can hold max.14 plates in slots firmly. 【DIY Adjustable Compartments Suit for Drying Big Cookware】--On the upper tier 5 detachable dividers create 4 adjustable slots for big or small size of cutting boards, frying pans, pot, pot lids, dishes or bakeware, etc, which is our advantage when comparing with others; also, the dividers designed with V shape on top edge for keeping the pan lid easily. 【Advantage Self-draining System Keeps Drying the Dishes Conveniently】--Our dish drying rack with drainboard can auto transfer the leaked water to the sink; this self-draining tray has smooth surface for easily cleaning and capturing the drips; one 360° rotating swivel spout assembled on the tray bottom can drain water in all directions to adapt the position of your sink. 【Fast Assemble without Any Tools in 1 Minute for Solid Result】-- Our space saving dish rack is made of round tubes painted with premium black coating, anti-scratched, rustproof, waterproof and without sharp edges; it is constructed of 5 major parts, they can be installed without any tools and any screws in 1 minute, and the self-locking system helps each part fix firmly; also, the assembled kitchen countertop organizer can bear the heavy weight (110 lbs) without collapsing. 【One Dish Drying Rack Stores All Your Cookware when Plus Extra Accessories】--1 detachable cutlery holder is placed on the upper tier; 1 detachable side shelf can store 8 glasses or cups; 3 removable hooks attached in another side for utensils or other lightweight items; 4 plastic screwed feet can be adjusted and keep the rack balance; therefore, our rack can store all your cookware, it is one of the best gift for your wife and your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jAtCmX9-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSUNECE","source_asin":"B09CKHDP2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKHDP2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKHDP2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1149705,"name":"Melange 6-Piece Melamine Bowl Set (Solids Collection ) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Bowls | Color: Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XhA28pSNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesnâ€™t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price youâ€™ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But weâ€™ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether youâ€™re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldnâ€™t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. Thatâ€™s why weâ€™ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyoneâ€™s eye.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XhA28pSNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074WF1TL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074WF1TL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074WF1TL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
