window.products.push({"id":1149715,"name":"Pie Supply 14 inch x 16 inch Aluminum Pizza Peel with 19 inch Long Detachable Wooden Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611cS8eh-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pie Supply’s restaurant-grade pizza peel with removable handle is the perfect tool for pizza-making enthusiasts. Your pizzas will easily glide right out the oven with our 14-gauge aluminum peel. This peel is sturdy and easy to clean, providing the strength and durability to withstand oven or grill use. The removable handle design and leather string provide two convenient ways to keep the pizza peel neatly stored and easily accessible. The oak wood handle provides a secure and comfortable grip. This handle allows you the stability to maneuver your pizza, while keeping a safe distance from the heat of the oven or grill. Our pizza peel is an essential tool for moving your pizzas into, around, and out of the oven. This sturdy peel works with any oven, outdoor grill, or wood-fired oven. Pie Supply’s pizza peel is not just for baking pizzas. You can use it to transfer pies, breads, cakes, pastries, and delicate desserts in and out of the oven. We recommend coating the blade's surface with cornmeal or flour before placing raw dough on it to reduce the chances of sticking. Dimensions: Peel Blade: 14\" W x 16\" L Wood Handle: 15.5\" (19.5\" Assembled) Overall Length: 35.5\" Long Care Instructions: Handwash the blade in warm, soapy water and dry thoroughly. Do not soak the wood handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611cS8eh-tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pie Supply","source_asin":"B087QMBF8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087QMBF8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087QMBF8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
