window.products.push({"id":1149805,"name":"Sahhika Rug Pad Gripper, 10 Pcs Non Curling Non Slip Reusable Rug Pad, Keep Your Rug in Place & Make Corner Flat, Washable Rug Tape for Hardwood Floor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mb15kxrrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reusable Washable Double Sided Carpet Tape Self Adhesive Carpet Binding Carpet tape Anti-slip Rug Gripper How To Use It? 1.Clean the applied surface.  2.Peel off white paper from back.  3.Stick and press it on the carpet.  4.Peel off protective film from back. Pros: To prevent accidents from slipping and sliding when your children or pets run through, or elder people walk through it, these non-skid rug grippers will keep your rugs in place. This restickable adhesive product is able to use on various smooth surfaces, This double sided adhesive rug gripper sticks on the floor firmly, anti-slip for safety, and anti-curling for a neat appearance. The anti-slip adhesive rug gripper sticks on the floor and leaves no sticky residue on the floor. When you removed the carpet ,it’s easy to clean the floor. Eliminating curling corners in your living room, hallway, or bedroom, the flat corners smooth centers and flawless rugs give you house a more pristine look Note: If you want to clean the carpet or floor, just wash the adhesive rug gripper or wipe it by wet clot. The adhesiveness will be the reactivated and will be as sticky as new! Please be sure the gripper is dry before you reuse.This rug gripper cannot be used on hot carpets, or on top of tatami or a carpet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mb15kxrrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sahhika","source_asin":"B092ZLVRV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092ZLVRV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092ZLVRV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
