window.products.push({"id":1149886,"name":"NPET Laundry Hamper Basket(multi-style), Protable Plastic Clothes Bag with EVA Waterproof & Breathable Mesh Material, Storage Bins for Laundry, Bathro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gig0fpg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EVA 【Classic, Simple and Generous Style】DIMENSION:15.7\"x 13.8\" x 10.6\", CAPACITY: 27L. Classic black is timeless and suitable for most decoration styles. It can be used in laundry room, bathroom, children's bedroom, dormitory, yard, etc. It can store items like Clothes or dirty Clothes, toys, Baby Products, Pet products, or any other household items around the house.This 27L capacity is better for storing small items. Keeping your living space neat and tidy in a stylish and decorative way. 【Thick Eva Waterproof Plastic Material】We promise there is no tearing problem like others on the market! It doesn't smell of plastic. The soft and thick cloth around the edge and no sharp edge provides a safe environment for your kids.EVA material with waterproof can also store wet clothes. It is light but strong enough, even in the empty cases, it can stand up perfectly, no worry about collapses all the time. It can collapse when not in use, saving space. It doesn't create creases. 【Considerate Design】 No steel wire support, no fear of hurting children. Breathable mesh structure can ventilate to avoid odors, conducive to storage of dirty clothes. The mesh extends the life of the basket, making it easier to see what's inside and find what you want faster and more easily. Mesh design can also make your room look spacious. The stitches are well constructed, durable and economical. 【Portable & Large Soft Handle】The reinforced sewing handle can hold more weight, allowing you to easily pick up the laundry basket. Laundry hamper is light and easy to move. When you travel or have a picnic, it is easy to carry and takes up little space when not in use. This EVA plastic laundry basket can be wiped with a wet cloth for daily cleaning, which is more convenient than other materials. 【Sincere Customer Support Services】Our Customer Service team is here to help should you have questions about your NPET laundry baskets; If you are not 100% satisfied for any reason, please let us know immediately. We will do everything we can to make you happy with your laundry hamper. We also provide 30-day money back, 12-month replacement (consider satisfaction guarantee?). Please contact us on any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gig0fpg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NPET","source_asin":"B08Q324XG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q324XG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q324XG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
