window.products.push({"id":1149935,"name":"Food Saver Vacuum Sealer Machine - Food Sealer With Dry & Wet Modes And 13\" Sealing Line Compatible With Bags Of Various Sizes, Built-in External VAC ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zu1QrC9AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DUUFUN Vacuum Sealer Machine are the perfect multi-functional kitchen appliance for any household. With Moist and Dry Modes, it can seal a variety of food items, while the built-in external VAC allows for sealing of wine, mason jars, and canisters, making it a versatile kitchen tool. Save money and keep your food fresh for longer with DUUFUN's Food Saver Vacuum Sealer Machine. By prolonging the freshness of your food, it helps to reduce food waste and ultimately saves you money. The sealing process also helps to maintain the aroma and flavor of your favorite dishes, making them taste better for longer. DUUFUN's Food Vacuum Sealer is incredibly easy to use. With the automatic one-touch food sealer, you can monitor the sealing process easily with the intelligent LED indicator. The vacuuming process only takes about 6 seconds, saving you time and making it a convenient kitchen tool. DUUFUN Food Vacuum Sealer Machine is built to last with its durable ABS material. You won't have to worry about stubborn food stains as it's easy to clean. The sealing wire is 13 inches long and compatible with various sizes of Vacuum Sealer Bags, making it a versatile machine. At DUUFUN, Our dedicated customer service team is available 24/7 to assist you with any concerns regarding our Vacuum Sealer. We take pride in providing exceptional after-sales support, ensuring your complete satisfaction with our product. Count on us for prompt and effective solutions to any issues you may face. Starter Kit includes everything you need to get started, such as an Air Suction Hose Vacuum Sealer Bags (12.4\"*7.8\"), a User Manual, and a Vacuum Sealer. With this machine, you can start preserving your food and enjoy the freshness for a longer time. The User Manual will guide you through the process so that you can make the most out of your new appliance right out of the box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zu1QrC9AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUUFUN","source_asin":"B0B8CK6WQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CK6WQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CK6WQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
