window.products.push({"id":1149959,"name":"6 Pack 9.25'' Reusable Metal Straws Collapsible Stainless Steel Drinking Straw Portable Telescopic Keychain Straw with Cleaning Brush & Case - Great I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7112fGgDltL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you know In just U.S alone, one estimate suggests 500 million straws are used every single day. About 8 million tons of plastic flow into the ocean every year, and straws comprise 0.025 percent of that. Why choose Tiblue reusable straws Tiblue’s mission is to reduce plastic use by providing you with reusable durable, collapsible, portable, practical, responsibly made and safeful straws. Try our best to save the planet, would you like to join in us? Features Telescopical design: It can be stretched and merged in three different length, so you can use it in all kind of cups or tumble as needed. Premium material: Premium food-grade stainless steel Material, BPA Free, safe and healthy plastic free, no metal aftertaste, no oxidation, colorfast, dishwasher safe, reusable. Easy to clean: Come with 1 special Telescopical scrub brush, with this banister brush, you can clean your straw more easily and never worry about hurting your straw. Portable: It come with a small metal case, easy to store and carry for outdoor picnics, camping, hiking, travelling, home and office use. Safe: After Polishing, grinding and indenting, the edge of the straws is concave and smooth. What’s more, it come with a silicone tip, you will never have to worry about hurting your mouth and teeth. Colorful: they’re the colour of rainbow, enjoy it with you colorful life. Specification - Material: 304 stainless steel- Straw’s Color:Rainbow & Silver- Case’s Color:Rose Gold/Pink/Blue- Length:9.25 inch- Outer Dimeter:0.25 inch/6mm、0.32/9mm Package includes - 6 * Reusable Drinking Straws- 6 * Straw Cleaning Brushes - 6 * Straw Carrying Cases Note 1.Boil the straw for sanitization before first use.2.Please do not use baking soda/bleaching powder to clean it.3.If there have incrustation,use vinegar to clean it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7112fGgDltL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiblue","source_asin":"B08LMHHZ2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LMHHZ2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LMHHZ2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
