window.products.push({"id":1149965,"name":"TopMats Round Area Rug - Modern Premium Indoor and Outdoor Durable Round Rug for Kitchen, Bedroom, Bathroom, Living Room, or Fireplace. Non-Skid, Wash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vPYGM20ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DECORATE ANY ROOM WITH A PREMIUM QUALITY AREA RUG: We took high quality and dense fibers to design and create a stylish and functional low pile premium rug that lasts long, comfortable, vibrant, and versatile enough to be used either as a functional rug or a trendy rug to enhance any space in your home. SIMPLE, DURABLE, BEAUTIFUL: This low pile premium area rug is super durable and requires very little maintenance, and its low pile fibers allow its color and design to pop out to provide any space with a more natural touch. It's the perfect rug for your bedroom, living room, or any indoor or outdoor space. The contemporary design is stylish and modern, while the soft fabric is comfortable underfoot. EASY CARE, MACHINE WASHABLE, AND RESISTANT TO STAINS: Easy to clean. Easy to Wash either by Hand or Machine. Vacuum-Friendly. Or just simply shake off to remove dirt as we make our round rug pad resistant to stains as well as fading or wear and tear. These are just the basic minimum standards we follow to create your new favorite round area rug. LUXURIOUSLY SOFT: TopMats low pile area rug has a luxury feel to its softness which is softer than most low pile rugs, making it the perfect kid and pet-friendly indoor/outdoor rug! The low pile density of its rug fibers is designed to be extra soft and gentle on the skin so it can be used in areas where they spend more time on the floor rolling around and playing with their toys and pets. NON-SLIP BACKING FOR SAFETY: TopMats rugs always care for your safety. That's why our rugs have non-slip, skid-resistant backing to prevent the rug from slipping and sliding on hardwood or tile floors. It's perfect for high foot traffic areas such as kitchens, bathrooms, living rooms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vPYGM20ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TopMats","source_asin":"B09R2NSVBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R2NSVBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R2NSVBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
