window.products.push({"id":1149979,"name":"Chinese Yixing Gongfu Tea Set Service Automatic Stone-Mill Pot Cups Gift for Tea Ceremony Party Home Office Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GyIVR9ZeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Tea set: purple sand tea set total 12pcs,Stone mill teapot with Dragon and Chinese characters (时来运转 every dog has his day) decoration,Ancient Chinese Sinan Compass design cover,teapot base Decorated with four mythical beasts, Dragon design fair cup,Extra 8 teacups with handle.Allowing you to serve 8 cups worth, whilst enjoying your tea with family and friends, whether that be at parties, dinners or any social gathering! Lazy Kung Fu Tea Design: When the handle of the stone teapot and the water outlet of the base are kept at 90 degrees, the water does not leak and can make tea. Turn the handle clockwise or counterclockwise, the water in the teapot slowly flows out, and the handle and the base water inlet are kept at 180 degrees. In a straight line, the filter port of the kettle reaches the maximum. Say goodbye to the cumbersome tea making process, semi-automatic design allows you to enjoy tea service. Ancient stone grinding principle design：The teapot is made in stone mill design is used to realize labor-saving effect and semi-automatic function. Two water outlet holes exist both teapot and base.Turning the handle 90℃,when 2 holes overlapped, the tea will flow out spontaneously. The diversion port adopts beak shape to allow the water to pour out smoothly in a centralized and strong way without splashing. Four-corner stone base is durable and stable ,no damage the table surface. Fine Stainless Steel Strainer：120-mesh strainer allows a finer filtration even for tea leaves crumble.Tea soup is clear. Great idea for gifts :This tea set with auspicious meaning is also a Feng Shui ornament at home or in the office.Give your family friends or business partner with such a unique gift ! This \"authentic-meets-modern-set” can be given as a house-warming, wedding or anniversary gift…the list is endless. This appeals to people of all ages and background. A Lucky and beautiful choice. Order your teapot now, while stock last - and another one for your friend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GyIVR9ZeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liang baobao","source_asin":"B07YKTD4FG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1149979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YKTD4FG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YKTD4FG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
